      "aboutPage": "<p>Recently, we created this database in order to provide an easy way for the general public to access, explore, and analyze the electoral history of this jurisdiction. Our mission is to consolidate into one searchable platform every candidate contest and ballot question on record for a period of time. This requires a process of ongoing data inventory and extraction among a variety of historical primary sources and compilations. We hope this database is helpful to you.</p>",
